# Faithless Looting discards Darksteel Colossus and Blightsteel Colossus together, and each is revealed and shuffled into
# Bot1's library instead of going to the graveyard. Two effects shuffle the library at once: what triggers on a shuffle
# triggers twice (CR 701.24f), so the history holds two shuffles of it. The library itself is randomized once, the result
# of both: the first two shuffles are fixed to reverse what they shuffle ([Shuffles]), and the library comes out reversed
# once - shuffled twice, the two reversals would undo each other and leave the Blightsteel on top.
[Shuffles]
Reverse
Reverse

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Darksteel Colossus
Blightsteel Colossus
Plains
Plains
Plains
Forest
Forest
Swamp x3
Plains x3

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Darksteel Colossus; Blightsteel Colossus)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Shuffles = 2
Bot1.Library = Plains; Plains; Plains; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Darksteel Colossus; Blightsteel Colossus
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Forest; Plains; Plains; Plains
